                                                "text": "I don't think Brooklyn slang is that different from Manhattan slang. But I'm not used to a lot of the slang my friends use. Months ago, I first heard, \"There are mad heads here.\" I was like, \"Where did that come from?\" For a while they were saying, \"That's type funny.\" I was like: \"What? What do you mean by that?\" It means \"very funny.\" Or they were like, \"That's dumb stupid.\" I'm like, \"That's redundant.\""
